sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant B as Browser
    participant N2 as nginx :11436 (TLS)
    participant WS as webui.sock
    participant W as Open WebUI :8080
    participant N1 as nginx :11435 (TLS)
    participant UP as ollama_pool
    participant O as ollama instance

    B->>N2: https://localhost:11436 (UI + SSE)
    N2->>WS: proxy to unix socket
    WS->>W: TCP :8080
    W->>N1: OLLAMA_BASE_URL https://172.30.0.1:11435
    N1->>UP: proxy_pass
    UP->>O: unix socket via socat
    O-->>W: SSE / JSON
    W-->>B: stream (buffering off)
